- **weak_v4** Qwen unconstrained, all 12 labels, positional JSON: LLM-only prec **0.623**, parse **0.799**. Audit bug: distributed v1 CSV already has gold on 58 experts → rejoining reported false 1.0. Historical pre-override prec **0.68755** in `docs/audit/weak_label_vs_expert.csv`.
- **weak_v5** consensus fill (named JSON, unlabeled cells only, gold stripped): parse **0.795**, combined prec **0.6897** (missed 0.69 by 0.0003), rec **0.667** (pass), coverage 7649→23911 (pass), LLM-fill prec **0.695**. MCL LLM-fill prec **0.27**. No candidate written. Audit: `docs/audit/weak_label_v5_vs_expert.csv`. Kernel: `girishbose/weak-labels-v5-consensus-qwen`.

**Architecture / cache**
- **cache_v2** 4×16: S **0.738**.
- **Unfreeze**, **expert head-FT**.
