- 5-fold, public LB, or submit until a new label recipe beats expert prec **and** rec, then seeded fold0 **0.745** **and** untouched fold1 **0.732**.
- Train on v4/v5 candidates (none shipped).
- Reopen MRI-CORE, 384 rank, routing, unfreeze, expert head-FT, or e5 alignment init.
- Treat Gemma/MedGemma as a submission classifier.
- Use reports at inference.
